<title>USA: Mednet delisted from Nasdaq SmallCap.</title>
<headline>Mednet delisted from Nasdaq SmallCap.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mednet MPC Corp said Wednesday that it has received notice that its common stock will be delisted from the Nasdaq SmallCap Market on June 18, due to its failure to file forms 10-K and 10-Q.</p>
<p>Mednet is a provider of managed prescription care services.</p>
<p>In May, the company had announced that the Nasdaq was seeking to delist its shares because it did not meet the necessary requirements for listing.</p>
</text>
